  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building guarantee contexts for freedom of expression and spaces of resilience for victims</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building guarantee contexts for freedom of expression and spaces of resilience for victims.

The objective of the project is to generate contexts that guarantee freedom of expression and spaces for resilience for relatives of journalists who have disappeared and/or were murdered in Mexico, through the promotion of regulatory changes in the Mexican Congress; improving the functioning of the Federal Protection Mechanism; and the strengthening of the national network of relatives of disappeared and/or murdered journalists made up of wives, daughters and sisters in search of justice.</narrative>
  </description>
